{"seq":2,"slug":"novel-view-synthesis","title":"新视角合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/foundations/novel-view-synthesis","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"新视角合成\">新视角合成</h1><p>你绕着一尊雕像拍了 60 张照片，每张都是某个固定角度的二维投影。现在想要一张「从雕像正上方俯视」的图——可你从没站到那个位置拍过。新视角合成（Novel View Synthesis，NVS）就是这个任务：给定一组已知视角的图像，合成任意未拍摄视角下的逼真图像。NeRF 和高斯泼溅本质上都是 NVS 的求解器，只是表示与渲染方式不同。这一篇把任务、输入、评测三件事钉死，后面所有方法都在这套协议下被比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>NVS 的形式化很干净。已知一组训练视角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{(I_i, \\pi_i)\\}_{i=1}^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是图像、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该图像对应的相机位姿（外参 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[R|t]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 与内参 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>）。目标是学到一个场景表示，使得对任意新位姿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都能渲染出与真实情况一致的图像 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>I</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat I^* = R(\\theta, \\pi^*)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。注意 NVS 不要求显式重建网格——只要新视角看起来对，内部表示是 MLP 还是椭球都无所谓。</p>\n<p>它和邻近任务的区别值得一提：立体匹配只求深度图，不渲染新视角；多视图立体（MVS）重建稠密点云或网格，关注几何精度而非渲染真实感；NVS 则把「渲染出以假乱真的新视角图像」本身作为目标，几何只是手段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[多张输入照片] --&gt; B[SfM / COLMAP&lt;br/&gt;估相机位姿 + 稀疏点云]&#10;  B --&gt; C{选择场景表示}&#10;  C --&gt; D[隐式 MLP 辐射场&lt;br/&gt;见 NeRF 章]&#10;  C --&gt; E[显式高斯椭球&lt;br/&gt;见高斯泼溅章]&#10;  D --&gt; F[在新位姿下渲染]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[与留出测试视角比对&lt;br/&gt;PSNR / SSIM / LPIPS]\">flowchart TD\n  A[多张输入照片] --&gt; B[SfM / COLMAP&lt;br/&gt;估相机位姿 + 稀疏点云]\n  B --&gt; C{选择场景表示}\n  C --&gt; D[隐式 MLP 辐射场&lt;br/&gt;见 NeRF 章]\n  C --&gt; E[显式高斯椭球&lt;br/&gt;见高斯泼溅章]\n  D --&gt; F[在新位姿下渲染]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[与留出测试视角比对&lt;br/&gt;PSNR / SSIM / LPIPS]</pre><h2 id=\"相机位姿从哪来-sfm-与-colmap\">相机位姿从哪来：SfM 与 COLMAP</h2><p>NVS 的隐藏前提是「每张训练图都带准确的相机位姿」。现实中你只有照片，位姿要靠运动恢复结构（Structure-from-Motion, SfM）估出来。事实标准工具是 COLMAP：它先在图像间提特征、做匹配，再通过捆绑调整（bundle adjustment）联合优化所有相机位姿和一批稀疏三维点。特征提取与匹配的底层视觉原理不在本 hub 展开，见 <a href=\"../../computer-vision/image-fundamentals/feature-extraction\">特征提取</a>。</p>\n<p>这一步的质量直接决定上限：位姿差几度，渲染就糊成一团。所以实践里有两条经验——拍摄时保证相邻图像有足够重叠、避免纯旋转无平移；以及对位姿做联合优化（一些 NeRF 变体允许在训练中微调位姿，对抗 COLMAP 的残余误差）。SfM 同时吐出的稀疏点云还有大用：高斯泼溅就拿它做初始化，详见 <a href=\"../gaussian-splatting/gaussian-representation\">3D 高斯表示</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么衡量好坏-三个指标\">怎么衡量好坏：三个指标</h2><p>NVS 的评测协议是把拍到的视角留出一部分当测试集，用模型在这些位姿下渲染，再和真值逐像素比。三个指标各有侧重，缺一不可。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>衡量什么</th>\n<th>越大越好?</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PSNR</td>\n<td>峰值信噪比</td>\n<td>像素级误差（基于 MSE）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>对模糊不敏感，易被平滑结果刷高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSIM</td>\n<td>结构相似度</td>\n<td>局部亮度/对比/结构</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>仍偏向像素对齐，感知相关性有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LPIPS</td>\n<td>学习感知图像块相似度</td>\n<td>深度特征空间的感知距离</td>\n<td>否（越小越好）</td>\n<td>依赖预训练网络，可能有偏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>PSNR 由 MSE 定义，写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PSNR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mfrac><msup><mtext>MAX</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>MSE</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PSNR} = 10 \\log_{10}\\!\\big(\\frac{\\text{MAX}^2}{\\text{MSE}}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PSNR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3679em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MSE</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MAX</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 MAX 是像素最大值。它简单但有个著名陷阱：一张过度平滑、丢了高频细节的图，MSE 反而可能更低，于是 PSNR 虚高。所以现代论文一定三个一起报——PSNR 看整体保真，SSIM 看结构，LPIPS 看人眼感知。一个方法只有三项都不落下风，才算真的好。这套协议从原始 NeRF 沿用至今，是 <a href=\"../nerf/nerf-mlp\">NeRF 的 MLP 表示</a> 和高斯泼溅同台竞技的公共标尺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标准数据集与基线\">标准数据集与基线</h2><p>为了可比，社区固定了几个基准场景：合成数据 Blender（NeRF Synthetic，8 个物体）、真实前向场景 LLFF、大规模真实场景 Mip-NeRF 360 与 Tanks and Temples、以及动态场景的 D-NeRF 数据集（动态场景的处理见 <a href=\"../practice/dynamic-neural-scenes\">动态与可变形场景</a>）。报告新方法时，惯例是在这些数据集上跑出 PSNR/SSIM/LPIPS 三件套，并附上训练时间与渲染 FPS——因为 2026 年的竞争早已不只是质量，而是「同等质量下多快训练、多快渲染」。例如在 D-NeRF 这类单目动态合成场景上，4D 高斯泼溅类方法能在实时帧率下做到约 34 dB 的 PSNR，这类数字只有放进统一协议里才有意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>新视角合成（NVS）的任务是：给定带位姿的多视角照片，合成任意未拍摄视角的逼真图像；NeRF 与高斯泼溅都是它的求解器。</li>\n<li>NVS 不要求显式网格，只要新视角看起来对——这区别于只求深度的立体匹配和重几何的 MVS。</li>\n<li>相机位姿靠 SfM（COLMAP）估出，位姿质量是渲染上限的硬约束；其稀疏点云还用于高斯泼溅初始化。</li>\n<li>评测用 PSNR（像素保真）、SSIM（结构）、LPIPS（感知）三件套，单看 PSNR 会被过度平滑刷高。</li>\n<li>社区固定了 Blender、LLFF、Mip-NeRF 360、Tanks and Temples 等基准，2026 年的比较额外强调训练时间与渲染 FPS。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>为什么要做神经渲染（任务的动机）：<a href=\"why-neural-rendering\">为何神经渲染</a></li>\n<li>各方法在地图上的位置：<a href=\"neural-rendering-spectrum\">神经渲染谱系</a></li>\n<li>两条主流求解路线：<a href=\"../nerf/nerf-mlp\">NeRF 的 MLP 表示</a>、<a href=\"../gaussian-splatting/gaussian-representation\">3D 高斯表示</a></li>\n<li>跨库：SfM 依赖的特征与几何基础见 <a href=\"../../computer-vision/image-fundamentals/feature-extraction\">特征提取</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"新视角合成","id":"新视角合成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"相机位姿从哪来：SfM 与 COLMAP","id":"相机位姿从哪来-sfm-与-colmap"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么衡量好坏：三个指标","id":"怎么衡量好坏-三个指标"},{"level":2,"text":"标准数据集与基线","id":"标准数据集与基线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何神经渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/foundations/why-neural-rendering"},"next":{"title":"神经渲染谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-rendering-nerf-gaussian/foundations/neural-rendering-spectrum"}}